notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-16T01:55:13.924Z","harness:claude-code","Adopted: commander ^15.1.0 and semver 7.8.6 (runtime; runtime-dependencies.json re-applied through scripts/release/runtime-lock.mjs apply), and vitest ^5.1.0, @vitest/coverage-v8 ^5.1.0, jscpd ^5.4.3 and parse5 8.1.1 (dev). Publication ages on 2026-11-16: 8, 13, 13, 13, 7 and 8 days.\n\nHeld back: @codspeed/vitest-plugin 6.1.1. The repository's pnpm patchedDependencies entry is pinned to @codspeed/core 6.1.0, and pnpm refuses the bump with ERR_PNPM_UNUSED_PATCH. Port or retire that patch first. Also still inside the seven-day window: typescript-eslint 8.72.2, marked 18.2.0, gpt-tokenizer 4.1.2, tar 7.5.23, knip 6.45.1 and eslint 10.15.0.\n\nLocal proof: the full pnpm quality:static chain passes, including mutation testing (356 of 363 killed, 7 equivalent). The full test suite passes after the GH-1735 test updates."
